": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPXHbiuHWIsQ7kNvwG2HjKL&_nc_oc=Adp4V2EN4AITYBxt2DKTUq1EVCKNYK3ZtkNMZVe_apB_TVjl4L9WTe5LzKEmFSdKQAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT3IUg77uX8pRcF3b45py3KbIIDmeazVvsr2VTnx0Dp8Q&oe=6AEDFB1B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oe7HCPHtXYEQ7kNvwH5so-l&_nc_oc=AdqV4TgJF34llLb9maxNYG7qR98LNmEzuiFWggIUvIOQ4QYq9ORJ5q9KIVxU2nc4CvM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRSfz5RwTdWE8iJOoydMLFh_ZCYdS70IgzEwaZZ889qzQ&oe=6AEDEB61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x-7b3U0ukbgQ7kNvwEUDehI&_nc_oc=AdpezxTquu_vh0JzyO6BV72uQHB1aqJWnqMGtqF4BfSHywEoU1PfIaFLp6aMRe4OHVw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKPiT6N7WI9pZ59R8m4649NN2j8ZD6kt1t3oyoBH_nog&oe=6AEDD82F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XD7b4n82w1YQ7kNvwHPISi3&_nc_oc=AdqurTZC2W6oS605Vg32JNp-ASsf4RtotpFC-0Hv6qYaMRdwvDisomCVtygaRWw72nw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSArNMP6jN6ywcbUjm9AaXoN5U-KYsoO6kTmodM0YDKeA&oe=6AEDD7D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X4hBFX4SSUkQ7kNvwGgbxGu&_nc_oc=AdqvOPr1Ux8u0oRdg7C0x7at--SIcv4vyR_bEVq7fgpijCvtnG0d6KwYK3b2Qlt6YfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0WAXj1SfaZrApzZuX_0_RAeV6tOShSMhXl9ixmvCTfw&oe=6AEDE17D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a